openmediavault-ro-api (1.0.2-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Fix OMV 7 RPC parameter schemas for Config::isDirty, PowerMgmt::getScheduleList,
    and Cron::getList to eliminate sub-RPC partial errors.
  * Skip S.M.A.R.T. queries on eMMC devices (/dev/disk/by-id/mmc-* and /dev/mmcblk*).
  * Add MinIO (S3), MdMgmt (MD RAID), AptMgmt, and CpuTemp::getSensors to omv_extras
    auto-discovery catalog.
  * Allow alphanumeric suffixes in read-only RPC method filter (e.g. CpuTemp::get2,
    Config::getlist).

 -- shurushetr <shurushetr@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:02:00 -0400

openmediavault-ro-api (1.0.1-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Fix adjacent string literal concatenation in OMVRpcServiceRoApi
    that caused a PHP parse error on omv-engined startup.
  * Guard ServiceManager::getService() boolean false return values.

 -- shurushetr <shurushetr@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:33:00 -0400

openmediavault-ro-api (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of openmediavault Read-Only API & Infisical Auditor plugin.
  * Provides token-authenticated RoApiProxy::query JSON-RPC endpoint with
    granular UI-controlled read scopes, automatic server-side password/secret
    redaction, subnet allowlisting, and optional Infisical Universal Auth sync.

 -- shurushetr <shurushetr@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:55:00 -0400
